message: "If you use Phocinae-Largha-150M-v1 (Largha) in your research or products, please cite it as below."
title: "Phocinae-Largha-150M-v1: A 144M-parameter bilingual typed decision model"
abstract: "A 144.3M-parameter non-generative typed decision model (noul/choice/score) built on an mmBERT-small backbone, with calibrated confidence and a τ-threshold escalation gate that keeps a large share of agent decisions local (zero output tokens)."
